<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p class="p1">It is hereby informed that, due to scheduled restoration works at the Palatine Chapel, opening and closing times will undergo temporary changes. During this period, some areas may not be accessible in order to ensure the safety of visitors and staff.</p>
<p class="p1">We apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your understanding. Your support helps us preserve this unique heritage.</p>
<p><strong>CLOSURE OF THE PALATINE CHAPEL</strong></p>
<p>Every Sunday, the Palatine Chapel will be closed to the public from 9.30 to 11.00</p>
<p><strong>EXTRAORDINARY CLOSURE NOVEMBER 2026</strong></p>
<p>On Monday, November 2 and Tuesday, November 3, 2026, access to the Palatine Chapel will not be possible for visitors with disabilities, due to the temporary closure of the entrance door for restoration work on the structure.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, November 24, 2026, the last ticket to visit the Palatine Chapel will be issued at 4:00 PM</p>
<p class="p3"><b>Please note that the Monumental Complex of the Royal Palace, as the seat of the Sicilian Parliament, and the Palatine Chapel may be subject to full or partial closures or schedule changes without prior notice due to institutional or religious reasons.</b></p>
	</div>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

	<div style="" class="vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column centered-text padding-3-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone "  data-using-bg="true" data-border-radius="10px" data-padding-pos="top-bottom" data-has-bg-color="true" data-bg-color="#f6f5f1" data-bg-opacity="1" data-animation="" data-delay="0" >
		<div class="vc_column-inner" ><div class="column-bg-overlay-wrap column-bg-layer" data-bg-animation="none"><div class="column-bg-overlay" style="opacity: 1; background-color: #f6f5f1;"></div></div>
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 style="text-align: center;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:400;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Royal Palace of Palermo</h4><p style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >The monumental complex is open every day, from Monday to Sunday, including public holidays.</p>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p class="p1"><b>Access hours include the following areas:</b><b></b></p>
<p class="p3">Palatine Chapel, Royal Apartments, Royal Gardens</p>
<p class="p3">Please check the specific opening times for each area directly at our ticket office.</p>
	</div>
</div>



<div class="divider-wrap" data-alignment="default"><div style="margin-top: 20px; height: 1px; margin-bottom: 20px;" data-width="100%" data-animate="" data-animation-delay="" data-color="extra-color-1" class="divider-border"></div></div><h2 style="font-size: 30px;text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >08:30 AM → 4:30 PM (last admission)</h2><p style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >From Monday to Saturday</p><div class="divider-wrap" data-alignment="default"><div style="margin-top: 10px; height: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-width="100%" data-animate="" data-animation-delay="" data-color="extra-color-1" class="divider-border"></div></div><div class="divider-wrap" data-alignment="default"><div style="height: 40px;" class="divider"></div></div><h2 style="font-size: 30px;text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >08:30 AM → 12:30 PM (last admission)</h2><p style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Sundays and public holidays</p><div class="divider-wrap" data-alignment="default"><div style="margin-top: 20px; height: 1px; margin-bottom: 20px;" data-width="100%" data-animate="" data-animation-delay="" data-color="extra-color-1" class="divider-border"></div></div><h2 style="font-size: 30px;text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Close</h2><p style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >December 25 and January 1</p>
		</div> 
