<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p class="p1"><b>Free Admission</b><b></b></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="p1">Accompanying teachers of students on educational visits (2 for every 15 students)</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1">Children and young people up to 13 years old, if accompanied by adults and not part of a school visit</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1">Teachers and students regularly enrolled in university courses in history, art, or literature</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1">Journalists, ICOM members, and employees of the Regional Department for Cultural Heritage and Sicilian Identity</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class="p1">Visitors with disabilities and one accompanying person, where applicable</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="p4">All conditions for reduced and free admission apply to European Union citizens and, under conditions of reciprocity, also to non-EU citizens.</p>
	</div>
</div>




			</div> 
		</div> 
