<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<div class="wpb_wrapper">
		<p class="p1"><b>Educational Visits for School Institutes Monumental Complex of the Royal Palace of Palermo</b></p>
<p>To ensure an optimal cultural experience, the Federico II Foundation provides the following information:</p>
<p>Visits take place from Monday to Saturday.</p>
<p>Tickets can be purchased online up to 10 days before the visit, or directly at the ticket office on the day of the visit.<br />
With online purchase, visitors may go directly to the entrance without stopping at the ticket office.</p>
<p>For both options, the required documentation must be presented.</p>
	</div>
</div>



